  "citation": "Arking A; Ridgway B; Clough T; Iacono M; Fomin B; Trotsenko A; Freidenreich S; Schwarzkopf D (1994): Intercomparison of Radiation Codes in Climate Models (ICRCCM) Infrared (Clear-Sky) Line-by Line Radiative Fluxes (DB1002). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (USA). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/SAR.DB1002",
